WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.920
Who's better at cooking,
me or Aaron?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.920
It's me, innit?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Homeboy,
not even a question.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.880
Yo, don't be lying
to the kid, fam.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.800
-He's not in my league.
-Shut up, man.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.800
Modie's gone down,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.880
so I'm running
the fucking mandem now.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.040
What are you gonna do
about the Turks, big man?

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.280
I'll chat to the Turks.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.760
-When?
-What the fuck, when?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.560
When I'm fucking ready, fam.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.720
Someone I know,
they have food, innit.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.440
They'll sell to us
way lower than the Turks.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.400
-Boom.
-Sorted.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.440
And you're, what?

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.400
Offering to widen
our market?

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.880
Yeah. We take your food
and sell it on the road.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.240
That sounds good.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.720
Yeah, we'll take care
of everything.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.960
All you have to do
is sit back

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.000
and watch the Ps
come to you.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.160
What Ps?

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:53.680
Money, bruv.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.480
You'll be taking
all the risk as well.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.160
Where I come from,
life is a risk.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.320
You either step up and take
your chances when they come,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.720
if not…
you ain't going nowhere.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.120
Man's got high grade
for sale.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.120
I've got white and B-dose.
What are you saying?

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.480
I'm saying,
where you getting this?

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.640
That's my business.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.400
Yeah, well, how much?

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.360
-White's 40 grand a kilo.
-Forty?

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.040
Bruv, allow them prices
there, fam.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.960
You think you're tough
and them tings, brudda?

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.640
Can't come to them prices
with bad man, rude boy.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:33.600
Listen, cut that up.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.600
You're making five times
that much, brudda.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.040
You best be doing
something, man.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:39.960
A'ight, Jamie is sick.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.000
-Who's that?
-What?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.520
-Oh, shit!
-Fucking hell!

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:47.480
Oh, shit!

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.440
Is Cam dead?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.520
No.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.120
So my point is, Jamie,
Cam didn't get your reply.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:17.720
Jamie, yeah?

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.720
The man then can keep doing

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.080
what they've always
been doing.

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:23.840
Shot whatever to whoever,

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.640
I really don't
give a fuck, bruv.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.440
Just do it on your ends.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.320
And if you need food,
come to me.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.520
So you think I'm here

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.040
to get your permission
to shot food?

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.880
You're here to get mine.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.480
You want to sell food,
you sell my food,

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.760
or you don't sell
nothing at all.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:47.360
Oh, shit!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.400
Listen, Stef,

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.520
nothing bad's ever
gonna happen to you

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.520
while I'm around.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.440
I ain't never let you
down before, have I?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.520
Have I?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.800
So I'm gonna do my job
and you do yours.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:22.240
I am gonna need some of
the Ps you've been making.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.320
In fact, fuck that.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.800
I'm going to need all of
the Ps you've been making.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.520
These are my ends. Mine!

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.240
Yeah?

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.360
And I'm staying
exactly where I am.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.440
I'm doing it!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.800
-Hands on the wheel!
-Don't shoot!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.000
Remain calm!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:43.680
Hands down!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.360
Gunshot!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:48.200
Yo, listen… Modie's dead.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.600
Yeah, we know.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.640
What about
that pussy Jermaine?

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.560
We ain't gonna hear
from Jermaine no more.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:54.920
What happened
to your face, man?

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.080
Don't worry about that.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.920
We have one more person
to take care of,

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.320
and that's Dushane.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.960
And that needs
to happen today.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.880
Tell A-Road, tell all
of these other crews,

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:06.320
I want everyone,
everywhere looking for him.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.280
D'you understand?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.520
If they see him,
shoot him on sight,

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.240
no matter
where the fuck he is.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.240
-So you've got my Ps?
-No.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.800
Your mum got it?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.960
We ain't got nothing.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.600
You'll have to do something
for me then, innit?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.560
Go on. Take that.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.520
Pick up the fucking bag.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.640
Don't fuck this up.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.200
-Armed police!
-Armed police!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:39.960
Firearms.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.240
No, that's… That's not mine.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.880
It was my bag.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.280
You nor Stef nor Abby
had nothing to do with this.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.880
Do you understand?
It's going to be OK, bro.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:04.720
Judge sees that…

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.440
drop the case real quick.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.960
You answer
the next question right,

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.120
I'll send it
to your lawyer tonight.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.480
What's the question?

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.320
After you get out,
you come and work for me.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.960
Are you being for real?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:26.920
Yes or no?

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:36.880
Hopefully, this time,

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.280
we don't have to make
the same mistake

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.680
we made last time,
though, do we?

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.120
Yeah, last time was
a little situation still.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.560
I got a link
to Spain and Morocco,

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.240
'bout to come through
with a big bit.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.680
More money than you ever
seen in your life, bro.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.400
Do you want to be
a part of it, or what?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.040
Part of it how?

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.360
By doing what
you've always done…

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.440
selling food.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.680
Your food, yeah?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.440
I guess it is, yeah.
My food.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.320
Why did Ats do that to us?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.000
They had him right
where they wanted,

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:15.920
so he had no choice.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.480
And if the people you love

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.680
know you'll be there
for them, no matter what,

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.000
then they're gonna be
there for you.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.720
It's like me and Kit.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.680
Something went wrong

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.480
and he was there for me
in a heartbeat.

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.360
And he knows if
it's the other way around,

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.000
it's gonna be
exactly the same.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:33.680
You get me?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:35.840
Yeah.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.680
But I was there for Ats.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.320
It was him
that weren't there for me.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.720
If you're close to someone

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.560
and they make a mistake,
and they didn't mean to,

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.760
or they only done it
because they had to,

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.880
then you gotta take that
on board.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.560
Now, don't let hate
eat you up, Stef,

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:56.920
because that ain't good
for no one.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:57.880
OK?

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.720
Give us a hand with this.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.120
Grab the bag.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.000
-Look!
-Fucking hell.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.200
There's a flight tomorrow
morning. I need you on it.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.640
You gotta sort out this shit
in Spain and Morocco for me.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.320
I can't just get up
and leave, fam.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.400
I've got my brothers here.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.200
-I need to be there.
-You stepping up, or what?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.800
Flight's at six.
Someone will meet you there.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.400
Dushane's problem is a guy
called Juan El Bueno.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.160
He's the key.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.920
You make him an offer.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.080
Once Dushane is out of
the way, he'll deal with us.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.400
He'll make a lot of money,

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.560
but you and I will make
fucking millions.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.520
You gotta keep your dog
on a short leash.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.920
If you think
they're gonna bite you,

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.120
you gotta put them down.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.080
Every top boy needs to know
when to make their move.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.800
So why don't you

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.080
give me a number that
I can take back to my boss

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.240
and then we'll go
from there?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.840
With this one, it was 10%.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.400
-Nice.
-Yeah.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.400
But now, it's 30.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:01.920
Thirty percent?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.200
Thirty percent of the value
of each shipment.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.680
You see, right now,

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.160
I'm chatting to you
for my boss, yeah?

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.800
But there might come
a time real soon

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.840
where I'm gonna chat to you
just for me, innit.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:15.640
So?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.600
So… you get the Duques
to supply me

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.840
with everything
that I need in London.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.200
Like I said before, no wars,

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.440
just money
and straight business.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.760
What are you doing here,
fam?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:29.680
I weren't expecting you.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.880
I just came to straighten
a few things out.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.560
I've been patternin' it.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.640
-Oh yeah?
-Yeah.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:39.600
Twenty-five?

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.280
Chief, if you have
something to say, say it,

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.800
otherwise move from man,
bro. Big man ting.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.760
Oi…

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.040
we're not even doing that.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:52.760
So, I'm watching you.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.120
You finished, yeah?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:59.840
Niñato…

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.000
you are very quiet tonight.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.840
Last time, you had plenty
to say for yourself.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.840
Big talk and big plans.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.400
Big fucking plans, yeah?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.840
Bro, what you talking about?

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.080
-You think I don't know?
-Know what?

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.240
You and Juan cosying up.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.680
This one.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.680
Look what we have here.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.040
Yo, what the fuck
are you doing, blud?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.720
What you saying about Jamie?

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.720
Look, it looked like one bag
of scheming going on to me.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.840
But you already know
how I feel.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:39.720
What about the brudda
that killed Ats?

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.400
What about him?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.720
We found him.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:46.760
Yeah, that's
a good thing, right?

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.440
Yeah,
you'd think that, innit.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.800
Your boy Kit rubbed him out

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.240
before I had a chance
to have a word

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.320
and get to the bottom
of exactly why he did it.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.360
Why do you think
he did that?

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.440
I don't know.
I weren't there, innit.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.120
Your boy robbed me
of all the answers.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:05.000
Now, it's over to you
to get them for me.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.760
Don't tell me that you
killed Ats, you know.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.920
Bruv, I didn't!

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.440
What happened?

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.560
My man was just supposed
to bad him up a likkle,

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:12.680
make him
know himself, innit.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.600
He weren't even supposed
to shank him like that.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:15.960
Why would you do that?

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.360
Bro, what kind of bredren
would I be

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.920
knowing what he did to you,
Aaron and Stef

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.440
and not do shit about it?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.160
Both of us, fucked.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.360
Kit's gotta go.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.120
What do you mean?

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.040
You know
what I fucking mean, man.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.840
If Kit ain't dead
by tomorrow,

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.320
then you are.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.960
We've gotta get the fuck
out of here today.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.760
The only thing is where?

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:44.280
Bruv, I've got a cousin
in Cardiff still.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.720
-Yeah?
-So he can…

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:47.880
He can help line us up.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.720
-We have to leave tonight.
-What?

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:51.360
We'll figure our way
around it.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.240
What do you mean
find a way around it?

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.720
There's no way around it.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.520
I'm not going.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.320
Aaron, this ain't about you
right now.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.320
Do you hear
what I'm saying to you?

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.160
It's about all of us,

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.240
making sure
that we're all safe.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.560
Why wouldn't we be safe?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.000
Go on, what did you do?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.760
Yo, where are you going,
Stef, man? Chill.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.080
Hey, Stef, man!

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.080
Ay, yo, chill!
What the fuck?

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.600
-Let her go!
-Get off me!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.960
-Yo!
-Yo, yo!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.400
Get the fuck off me, man!

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.240
Does he know
what he's just fucking done?

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.240
Yo! Bruv, what the fuck
are you man doing?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.120
You good, yeah?

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.520
-Hey, what the--
-Step the fuck back!

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:41.600
You lot don't want
this smoke,

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.880
I fucking told you that.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.520
Stef, don't even worry.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.480
We ain't goin' anywhere.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.840
Everything that I do…

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.000
and all that I care about

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.000
is the two of you.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.960
You and Stef, that's it.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.600
Cuz, what's with the gloves?

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.120
Bro!

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.640
See, whatever the beef is
between you two,

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.360
what I do believe is Jamie

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.400
is our fucking
retirement plan, bro.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:30.960
It's like you want
to be out here

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.640
on the roads in your old age
or something.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:34.720
I don't.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.720
So that's what it is.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.600
Well, you know what,
maybe you're right.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.520
I think it's time
we moved on.

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:03.600
Jamie!

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.280
-Jamie!
-Jamie!

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.640
Jamie!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.480
Jamie, wake up, please.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.600
Wake up, please.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.840
Jamie, wake up.
Jaime, look at me.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.800
Wake up, please. Jamie!

